OL,3,GNEWSACalls for lower speed limit after 
OL,4,Apupil hit by car                       
OL,6,FCampaigners are calling for a lower    
OL,7,Fspeed limit on a road outside a primary
OL,8,Fschool after a pupil was hit by a car. 
OL,10,FThe head teacher of St Mary's C of E   
OL,11,Fprimary school in Truro, Louise        
OL,12,FStevenson, has handed councillors a    
OL,13,Fpetition signed by more than 800 people
OL,14,Fdemanding a 20mph (32km/h) speed limit 
OL,15,Fand improvements to the zebra crossing 
OL,16,Fon Kenwyn Road.                        
OL,18,FPolice reported a child was taken to   
OL,19,Fhospital with minor injuries after     
OL,20,Fbeing hit by a car after leaving school
OL,21,Fon 12 November, the Local Democracy    
OL,22,FReporting Service said.                
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
