OL,3,GNEWSACalls for lower speed limit after 
OL,4,Apupil hit by car                       
OL,6,FCornwall Council cabinet member for    
OL,7,Ftransport, Dan Rogerson, said he would 
OL,8,Fdiscuss the issue with the local       
OL,9,Fhighways manager.                      
